    <string name="limitations">Read limitations</string>
    <string name="version_line">Neurio prototype %1$s</string>
    <string name="limitations_title">Honest limitations</string>
    <string name="limitations_body">1. INPUT — Stock Android has no public API to inject touches into another app. Neurio uses AccessibilityService.dispatchGesture, which requires your explicit opt-in and works for touch-controlled games. Titles that need a physical controller or block injected input will not respond.\n\n2. AUDIO — Internal game audio (AudioPlaybackCapture) only works when the game opts in; most big titles do not, so Neurio detects silence and can fall back to the microphone.\n\n3. ADAPTIVE — Resolution changes restart the encoder (brief pause); bitrate changes are seamless.\n\n4. SCOPE — Single client per host, LAN only, no internet routing, pairing-code + HMAC session auth.</string>

